              "content": "Trigger inventory (all drive the same banner): save outcome rerendered:false · dropped WS frame · page remount / Concierge reopen · out-of-band source push. Derivation is content-addressed: source blob shas in the current listing vs the newest model.likec4.json commit's tree — .md writes neither flag nor mask staleness.",
